  "content": "\n\n<h3><span><span><iframe style=\"width:764px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/4hqmVJGlf4Y\" width=\"764\" height=\"449\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></h3>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3><em style=\"font-size:16px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1450057/description_9cd6d9fc-f84f-4606-82d9-5645f92366c2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"804\" height=\"216\"></strong></em></h3>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h2><em><strong>擊敗古代城邦的監守者，打造古代棱鏡，穿越傳送門進入黑暗而神秘的幽匿維度。探索古代遺跡、多彩的生態域，以及隱藏在黑暗中的秘密。與這些土地上墮落的古代英雄戰鬥，將它們從幽匿中解放出來！</strong></em></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><em>本模組新增了許多裝飾方塊、5 個生態域、數種生物、2 款具有變體的獨特武器，以及結構內的 Boss 戰。模組還新增了防具、武器、工具、可將物品轉化為神器的方塊，以及更多內容！</em></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1450057/description_eb4fa902-69ab-4ce2-b108-9111bc2b1b5c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"848\" height=\"228\"><br></em></span></strong></h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\"><em><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1450057/description_1fe8a676-f012-47b6-8e32-55444a5506b3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"492\" height=\"162\"></em></span></strong></a></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\">提供更好的戰鬥支援！</span></a></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\"><strong>我的其他專案</strong></span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/call-from-the-depths\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1450057/description_c81d9491-b686-43c1-a97c-5613f57a7cfb.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"804\" height=\"216\"></a><br></span></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f8cac6\"><strong><em>訂閱我的 YouTube 頻道！我所有模組的音樂都在那裡！</em></strong></span></h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@rn6erensix\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1450057/description_ce949ae6-5afc-4e02-a3a9-4934c8c9ae57.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"804\" height=\"265\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>非常感謝您！</strong></p>",
